      "side": 1,
      "message": "Feeling kind of like a broken record but here we go again... The RTC I\u0027m talking about is in the firmware and has a default date. A seperate service sets the hypervisor and Android system time according the RTC that is inaccessible to Android and uses a protocol that Android does not understand. So a separate service is needed. \n\nThis change is configured via resource overlay and the default behavior is unchanged.\n\nFor why it is called in the first place was because of feedback from @suprabh (Suprabh Shukla).\n\nIs it possible to have a call so everyone is aligned?\nThis should have been clear in the bug ticket.",
